  "prefLabel": "Plc 2005.03 Applying for Certification Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2005.03 Applying for Certification Renewal. A certified CHW who wishes to renew a certification to practice as a certified CHW shall apply for renewal by complying with Plc 308.05, subject to the following:\n\n(a) On or with the profession-specific supplement required by Plc 308.05(b)(2), the applicant shall provide the information and attestation relative to meeting continuing education requirements specified in Plc 2004.04(b); and\n\n(b) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002.54, provided that an applicant applying to renew who is active military or a military spouse shall not pay the fee.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
